            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[<h2>Reliable PyCharm Claude handoff</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Self-assigned NHI tasks now resume the exact local Claude Code session that created the delegation.</li>
  <li>PyCharm is given time to finish loading its new project before Email Reminder opens Terminal and sends Claude the briefing.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
